.TH GRID_FIRST_VISIBLE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_first_visible \- Index of the first item inside the window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "int grid_first_visible(const Grid *g);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Index of the first item inside the window. Together with grid_end_visible this is the render loop: for (i = grid_first_visible(g); i < grid_end_visible(g); i++) draw at grid_cell_rect(g, i).
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_end_visible (3),
.BR grid_cell_rect (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
